  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="-Overview (這支流程的功能是把多語系訊息檔(Excel)讀進來，轉換成一個字典(Dictionary)物件，讓其他流程可以用「訊息編號」查詢出對應語言的文字內容。整體是標準的「多語系訊息載入器」設計。)&#xA;Return a dictionary object with localized message based on OS Language, specified in Message_File.xlsx.&#xA;&#xA;-Input/Output&#xA;out_Messages as Dictionary with all localized messages. Dictionary &lt;String, String&gt;" DisplayName="SRC_LocalizedText" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="939,3930" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_10">
    <Sequence.Variables>
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Name="Language" />
